  "text": "Learn more\nhark pro\n\nA new kind of system for getting things done.\nWhatever you need, let Hark handle it.\n\nContinue with Google\nContinue with Apple\nor\nContinue\nBy continuing, you agree to our Terms of Service and acknowledge that your data will be processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy.\n\nBook me a trip to Mexico City next weekend. Find the cheapest flights and a nice hotel in Polanco.\n\nMake everyday easier\nChat with Hark in a single thread for whatever you need. Book a table for that birthday dinner, submit expenses from email receipts, or do quick research. Hark has persistent memory, so it tailors responses to actually be useful to you.\nKeep bigger undertakings like job searches or trip planning organized with Projects.\nAll from the Hark Pro app on browser, iOS, and Android\nConsider it handled\nby Hark Handoff\nHark’s computer use agent, Handoff, can use the internet just like you would. It can build websites, do research, place orders, make slides, you name it. All from its own secure computer with a full browser that’s individual to you.\nRest assured it's\nSecured by hark\nSecured by hark has end-to-end encryption so your data stays safe. You’ll want to connect accounts, save logins, and make payments on Hark. That’s a lot of info you’re trusting us with. Think of this as a vault that absolutely no person has access to.\nPlus, Hark checks in with you before doing something that requires your approval.\nTap it off your list\nHark’s Action Buttons are the to-do list you’ve always dreamed of. Hark suggests and prioritizes these based on what it knows you have on your plate. All you have to do is click on it and Hark will perform that action from start to finish.\nThanks, it’s custom\nCreate your own customized Panels to stay on top of whatever you like. All you do is describe what you want and Hark will build mini-apps completely tailored to you.\nYou can ask your Panels questions to dig deeper into their data, unlocking even more from services you already use like Strava, Spotify, and Venmo.\nEpic Capability. Enterprise Security.\nSecurity at Hark\nAt Hark, we are building the most personal, human-like intelligence in the world.\nOur Manifesto\nSign up for Hark\nContinue with Google\nContinue with Apple\nor\nContinue\nCompany\nManifesto\nCareers\nNews\nSecurity\nPricing\nResources\nUsing Hark\nHelp Center\nLegal\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nOther Policies\nGet on App Store\nGet on Play Store\nSocial\nInstagram\nX\nLinkedIn\nHark © 2026",
